flowchart TD
  Target["Target primitive: quantum P plus classical Q on secp256k1"]
  Algorithm["Algorithm"]
  Optimization["Optimization"]

  Target --> Algorithm
  Target --> Optimization

  Algorithm --> Contract["Four-register ABI: quantum target_x and target_y; preserved classical offset_x and offset_y"]
  Algorithm --> Affine["Affine addition: lambda = (Py - Qy) / (Px - Qx)"]
  Algorithm --> Reversible["Reversible compute, apply, and uncompute schedule"]

  Contract --> Result["Overwrite target registers with R = P + Q"]
  Affine --> Differences["Coordinate differences dx = Px - Qx and dy = Py - Qy"]
  Differences --> Pair1["Kaliski pair 1: invert dx, apply dy times inverse, then uncompute"]
  Pair1 --> Lambda["Remove the raw 2^511 inverse scale to obtain lambda"]
  Lambda --> XCoordinate["Form Rx and the second denominator Qx - Rx"]
  XCoordinate --> Pair2["Kaliski pair 2: uncompute lambda while forming Ry"]
  Pair2 --> Result
  Reversible --> Cleanup["Backward replays restore every inverse workspace and free lambda"]
  Cleanup --> Result

  Optimization --> Baseline["Correctness-first baseline: full 2N - 1 = 511 Kaliski schedules"]
  Optimization --> NonceFree["Nonce-free operation stream: no identity tail, tail rewrite, or seed grinding"]
  Optimization --> Arithmetic["Cuccaro modular arithmetic with secp256k1 pseudo-Mersenne reductions"]
  Optimization --> Frontier["Optimization frontier: reduce Kaliski/apply cost without truncation failures"]

  Baseline --> Metrics["Trusted baseline: 2841 qubits, 5180786 average Toffoli, score 14718613026"]
  NonceFree --> FiatShamir["SHAKE256 test inputs derive only from the arithmetic stream"]
  Arithmetic --> Karatsuba["Karatsuba multiplication between inverse pairs; schoolbook multiply/apply inside pairs"]
  Frontier --> Evidence["Only a complete trusted 9024-shot pass establishes a valid improvement"]

  Result --> Validation["Trusted validation"]
  Metrics --> Validation
  FiatShamir --> Validation
  Karatsuba --> Validation
  Evidence --> Validation
  Validation --> Checks["9024 shots: classical correctness, reversibility, phase cleanliness, and workspace cleanup"]
  Validation --> Commitments["Package commitments: ops.bin hash plus architecture.mmd hash"]
